<title>PERU: Southern Peru Ltd 11-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>Southern Peru Ltd 11-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 329.7 million soles vs 582.4 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 1.735 billion soles vs 2.234 billion soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Majority owned by ASARCO Inc and Peru's largest copper producer, Southern accounts for over 60 percent of Peru's total copper output.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
